Forward dependency note for slice 0002:
  Slice 0002 should design the alert_rule_state schema with this merge in
  mind. Suggested columns:
      rule_id              BIGINT  NOT NULL
      vehicle_id           BIGINT  NOT NULL  -- 0 = fleet-rule baseline
      latched_at           TIMESTAMPTZ NULL  -- once-mode latch timestamp
      last_fired_at        TIMESTAMPTZ NULL  -- supersedes both in-memory clocks
      fire_count_since_reset INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 0  -- for slice 0003 cap
      hour_window_start    TIMESTAMPTZ NULL  -- for hourly cap (CooldownFSM)
      fire_count_hour      INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 0
      PRIMARY KEY (rule_id, vehicle_id)

  R1 mitigation (concurrent batch race):
      INSERT ... ON CONFLICT (rule_id, vehicle_id)
      DO UPDATE SET ... WHERE alert_rule_state.last_fired_at IS NULL
                            OR EXCLUDED.last_fired_at > alert_rule_state.last_fired_at + cooldown
      RETURNING xmax;  -- non-zero = we won the race, safe to fire

